  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut eggplant (see ingredients) into bite-sized chunks.<br>• Thinly slice capsicum.<br>• Place eggplant and capsicum on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil (1 tbsp <br>per person), season with salt and toss to coat.<br>• Spread out evenly, then roast until edges are just starting to brown, 10 minutes.<br>TIP: Adding enough oil will ensure the eggplant softens in time. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a448818bcb653703ca99ffd/step-b645da00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop coriander stalks, reserving leaves to garnish.<br>• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges.<br>• In a large baking dish, combine diced tomatoes with garlic &amp; onion (see <br>ingredients), coriander stalks, lemon zest, chermoula spice blend and the <br>water. Add the sugar and a drizzle of olive oil, then season with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a448818bcb653703ca99ffd/step-6da1e510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Transfer roast veggies to the baking dish with the sauce, then stir to combine.<br>• Place block of smooth fetta in the centre of baking dish.<br>• Bake until fetta is soft and lightly golden, 15-20 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a448818bcb653703ca99ffd/step-7d8b7720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When shakshuka has 5 minutes remaining, drizzle or brush flatbreads with olive <br>oil. Place directly onto oven rack and bake until golden around the edges,  <br>2-3 minutes.<br>• Divide shakshuka-style fetta and eggplant bake between bowls. Tear over <br>coriander leaves.<br>• Tear flatbreads and serve with lemon wedges. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a448818bcb653703ca99ffd/step-ffcffe30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
